[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11400.469, "timestamp": "03:10:00", "text": "但它很贵，而且确实不是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11402.87, "timestamp": "03:10:02", "text": "已在印度上映，所以我得等一段时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11405.67, "timestamp": "03:10:05", "text": "还需要一两年时间才能上映。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11409.03, "timestamp": "03:10:09", "text": "对，就像溪流甲板一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11412.309, "timestamp": "03:10:12", "text": "是的。我究竟要去哪里？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11414.95, "timestamp": "03:10:14", "text": "不知道。我们就在这里等死吧。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11418.389, "timestamp": "03:10:18", "text": "去。我们去死吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11421.59, "timestamp": "03:10:21", "text": "看看他撞车多少次。为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11424.309, "timestamp": "03:10:24", "text": "我开车技术很好。一辆车。我开车就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11427.03, "timestamp": "03:10:27", "text": "现实生活中千万别这样开车。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11429.75, "timestamp": "03:10:29", "text": "相信我。我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11433.67, "timestamp": "03:10:33", "text": "完全崩溃了。即使我开车像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11457.67, "timestamp": "03:10:57", "text": "好的，"}]